OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked after
OL,4,Asending sexualised messages to
OL,5,Avulnerable woman
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer has been sacked after
OL,8,Fsending sexualised messages to a
OL,9,Fvulnerable woman whose harassment
OL,10,Fcomplaint he was investigating.
OL,12,FHe also failed to properly investigate
OL,13,Fcounter-allegations made by her
OL,14,Fex-partner, a Police Ombudsman
OL,15,Finvestigation has found.
OL,17,FHugh Hume, chief executive of the
OL,18,FPolice Ombudsman's Office, said the
OL,19,Fofficer had shown "all the hallmarks of
OL,20,Fpredatory behaviour".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
